          <div>
            <div>
              <h2 id="a-single-platform-where-everything-works-together"><strong>A single platform where everything works together</strong></h2>
              <p>BambooHR saves you time and effort so you can focus on what matters most—growing your people, improving the employee experience, and taking your business forward.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cards stacking content-width-lg spacing-top-lg spacing-bottom-xl">
          <div>
            <div>
              <h3 id="hr-data--reporting"><strong>HR Data &#x26; Reporting</strong></h3>
              <h5 id="employee-records"><strong>Employee Records</strong></h5>
              <h5 id="automated-reporting"><strong>Automated Reporting</strong></h5>
              <h5 id="mobile-app"><strong>Mobile App</strong></h5>
              <p>BambooHR is your one-stop shop for data management, with instant, pre-built reports, automated workflows, and in-depth analytics to back you up and keep you moving.</p>
              <p><a href="/fragments/modals/demo">Get a Demo</a></p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <picture>
                <source type="image/webp" srcset="./media_1e07622c55257f8648e28705bdbf50dd253e0acdb.png?width=2000&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium" media="(min-width: 600px)">
