              </picture>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div>
              <h3 id="hiring--onboarding"><strong>Hiring &#x26; Onboarding</strong></h3>
              <h5 id="applicant-tracking"><strong>Applicant Tracking</strong></h5>
              <h5 id="candidate-experience"><strong>Candidate Experience</strong></h5>
              <h5 id="onboarding-tasks"><strong>Onboarding Tasks</strong></h5>
              <p>Find, hire, and onboard the best talent quickly. With the powerful BambooHR applicant tracking system and proactive onboarding tasks, you can create a compelling candidate experience and better first days for new hires.</p>
              <p><a href="/fragments/modals/demo">Get a Demo</a></p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <picture>
                <source type="image/webp" srcset="./media_12aae53247bb79dc368aa02d26935eac260e84b38.png?width=2000&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium" media="(min-width: 600px)">
