              </picture>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div>
              <h3 id="payroll-time--benefits"><strong>Payroll, Time &#x26; Benefits</strong></h3>
              <h5 id="time-tracking"><strong>Time Tracking</strong></h5>
              <h5 id="benefits-enrollment"><strong>Benefits Enrollment</strong></h5>
              <h5 id="payroll-automation"><strong>Payroll Automation</strong></h5>
              <p>Track hours and manage multi-rate pay, simplify time off requests, streamline benefits enrollment, and run payroll all from a single platform. No more data double entry or manual approval processes—just easy, accurate payroll for you and your employees.</p>
              <p><a href="/fragments/modals/demo">Get a Demo</a></p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <picture>
                <source type="image/webp" srcset="./media_16036d6b09ceca9a1f6cb0dffdf3e71531d88cc3f.png?width=2000&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium" media="(min-width: 600px)">
