      <div>
        <div class="spacer spacer-xl"></div>
        <div class="title content-width-md spacing-none heading-accent-color-green-3">
          <div>
            <div data-align="center">
              <h2 id="bamboohr-customers-save-hundreds-of-hours-and-reduce-hr-costs-by-40">BambooHR customers save hundreds of hours and <u>reduce HR costs by 40%</u></h2>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cards 3-columns image-fit divider spacing-lg">
          <div>
            <div data-align="center">
              <p><strong>Saved $70,000</strong> a year in time-savings using pre-built and custom reports.</p>
              <p>
                <picture>
                  <source type="image/webp" srcset="./media_1f26ffd0a1953850910b470f6260b6d3f9f1267af.png?width=2000&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium" media="(min-width: 600px)">
                  <source type="image/webp" srcset="./media_1f26ffd0a1953850910b470f6260b6d3f9f1267af.png?width=750&#x26;format=webply&#x26;optimize=medium">
                  <source type="image/png" srcset="./media_1f26ffd0a1953850910b470f6260b6d3f9f1267af.png?width=2000&#x26;format=png&#x26;optimize=medium" media="(min-width: 600px)">
                  <img loading="lazy" alt="" src="./media_1f26ffd0a1953850910b470f6260b6d3f9f1267af.png?width=750&#x26;format=png&#x26;optimize=medium" width="379" height="129">
                </picture>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
